---
import { LOGIN_URL, nav, SIGNUP_URL } from '../data/content';
import Logo from './Logo.astro';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-border py-12 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
  <div class="container-page grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr_1fr]">
    <div>
      <Logo class="text-base text-foreground" />
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
        Planejamento financeiro pessoal por chat: saldo, faturas e projeção de 24 meses, na web e no WhatsApp.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-xs leading-relaxed">
        Não fazemos recomendação de investimentos (Resolução CVM 19). Dados tratados conforme a LGPD.
      </p>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Rodapé">
      <p class="font-semibold text-foreground">Produto</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2">
        {nav.map((n) => <li><a href={n.href} class="hover:text-foreground">{n.label}</a></li>)}
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <div>
      <p class="font-semibold text-foreground">Acesso</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2">
        <li><a href={SIGNUP_URL} class="hover:text-foreground">Criar conta</a></li>
        <li><a href={LOGIN_URL} class="hover:text-foreground">Entrar</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container-page mt-10 flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-border pt-6 text-xs sm:flex-row sm:justify-between">
    <p>© {year} Saúde Financeira.</p>
    <p>
      Fotos: Vitaly Gariev no <a href="https://unsplash.com/@silverkblack" rel="noopener" class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-foreground">Unsplash</a>.
      Telas do app com dados fictícios.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
